and I will answer every single question.

00:07:13.720 --> 00:07:18.040
Okay, so step seven is record your

00:07:15.880 --> 00:07:19.640
video. You do not need a fancy camera,

00:07:18.040 --> 00:07:21.120
you don't need a studio, you don't need

00:07:19.640 --> 00:07:23.160
any of that stuff, okay? You need your

00:07:21.120 --> 00:07:25.040
phone and decent lighting. That's it.

00:07:23.160 --> 00:07:26.480
And honestly, phones are so good now

00:07:25.040 --> 00:07:28.000
that you barely even need the decent

00:07:26.480 --> 00:07:30.160
lighting part. You also want to record

00:07:28.000 --> 00:07:31.720
in landscape mode. That's horizontal.

00:07:30.160 --> 00:07:32.920
YouTube, of course, is a horizontal

00:07:31.720 --> 00:07:34.760
platform. And if you mess up

00:07:32.920 --> 00:07:36.120
mid-sentence, just pause, collect your

00:07:34.760 --> 00:07:37.880
thoughts, then keep going. And you can

00:07:36.120 --> 00:07:39.080
always cut it out later. Or don't. Some

00:07:37.880 --> 00:07:40.720
of the best performing videos on my

00:07:39.080 --> 00:07:42.840
channel have mistakes in them. Because

00:07:40.720 --> 00:07:44.920
right now, authenticity beats perfection

00:07:42.840 --> 00:07:46.720
every single time. Now, I recommend just

00:07:44.920 --> 00:07:48.080
recording with your phone. However, if

00:07:46.720 --> 00:07:50.360
for some reason you don't have a phone,

00:07:48.080 --> 00:07:51.880
you could also use your laptop webcam.

00:07:50.360 --> 00:07:54.000
And in that case, if you want to record,

00:07:51.880 --> 00:07:56.160
I highly recommend using Descript.

00:07:54.000 --> 00:07:58.240
Descript is a free recording software.

00:07:56.160 --> 00:07:59.600
It also has a teleprompter feature on

00:07:58.240 --> 00:08:01.280
it. So, if you're writing your entire

00:07:59.600 --> 00:08:03.120
