00:08:01.280 --> 00:08:04.520
that feature, and it actually is built

00:08:03.120 --> 00:08:06.160
into Descript. And you basically just

00:08:04.520 --> 00:08:07.560
want to put the box for the teleprompter

00:08:06.160 --> 00:08:08.960
towards the top of the screen, right

00:08:07.560 --> 00:08:10.680
