00:08:10.680 --> 00:08:13.440
So, if you're recording off-the-cuff

00:08:11.840 --> 00:08:14.880
content where you just have an outline,

00:08:13.440 --> 00:08:16.840
use your phone. If you want to record

00:08:14.880 --> 00:08:18.360
everything word for word, use Descript

00:08:16.840 --> 00:08:19.840
and your webcam. And this is assuming

00:08:18.360 --> 00:08:21.560
that you don't already have a camera set

00:08:19.840 --> 00:08:23.240
up and a teleprompter, etc. All right,

00:08:21.560 --> 00:08:25.200
step eight, edit your video. Most

00:08:23.240 --> 00:08:27.280
beginners spend days editing their first

00:08:25.200 --> 00:08:29.280
video, and that is a mistake. Your goal

00:08:27.280 --> 00:08:30.960
right now is simple, get it done, get it

00:08:29.280 --> 00:08:33.080
published. All you need to do is cut the

00:08:30.960 --> 00:08:34.919
