00:08:33.080 --> 00:08:37.440
That's it. You should be done in under

00:08:34.919 --> 00:08:38.599
10 minutes. So, use Descript or CapCut

00:08:37.440 --> 00:08:39.960
if that's what you're already using

00:08:38.599 --> 00:08:42.159
because both are beginner-friendly.

00:08:39.960 --> 00:08:44.440
Descript even removes filler words like

00:08:42.159 --> 00:08:47.160
um and uh automatically, and it has a

00:08:44.440 --> 00:08:48.440
really amazing AI feature that does 80%

00:08:47.160 --> 00:08:50.200
of the work for you. But, whatever you

00:08:48.440 --> 00:08:51.600
do, keep it simple and don't over-edit.

00:08:50.200 --> 00:08:53.000
Now, Descript, if you use the free

00:08:51.600 --> 00:08:54.680
version, is going to have a watermark

